{"_meta":{"openai/outputTemplate":"ui://widget/payroll-v2.html","openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Conformance draft ready","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Drafting the SF-1444\u2026","ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://widget/payroll-v2.html"}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Draft conformance request"},"description":"Use when a worker performs a classification that is missing from the WD and the contractor must ask the contracting officer to add it. Fills the SF-1444 fields, compares the proposed rate with related WD classifications, and checks the criteria of 29 CFR 5.5(a)(1)(iii)(A) (each answered yes / no / to verify). Related classifications come from neighbourRowIds (get_wage_rates on the pasted wdText, passed again here) or are given directly. Example: missingClassification=\"Drone operator\", tasks=[\"aerial survey\"], wd=\"TX20260291\", wdText=\"General Decision Number: TX20260291 \u2026\", neighbourRowIds=[\"r1\"], proposed={base:24,fringe:0}.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"answers":{"properties":{"doesNotSplitWdClassification":{"type":"boolean"},"usedInAreaByConstructionIndustry":{"type":"boolean"},"workNotPerformedByWdClassification":{"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"header":{"properties":{"contractNumber":{"maxLength":80,"type":"string"},"contractor":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"dateBidOpened":{"maxLength":20,"type":"string"},"dateOfAward":{"maxLength":20,"type":"string"},"dateOfRequest":{"maxLength":20,"type":"string"},"dateWorkStarted":{"maxLength":20,"type":"string"},"location":{"maxLength":160,"type":"string"},"projectAndDescription":{"maxLength":300,"type":"string"},"subcontractor":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"missingClassification":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"neighbourRowIds":{"default":[],"description":"rowIds of related WD classifi